{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":1,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":132,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1913402,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":280992,"Name":"MissFrench","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280992.jpg?_r=1462713598","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":201,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1462670627,"LastPoster":{"Id":280992,"Name":"MissFrench","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280992.jpg?_r=1462713598","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":201,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":98,"Preview":{"Id":1913402,"PostDate":1462670627,"PostContent":"Brand new, in the box directly purchased from Ugg Australia.\u00a0 Size 8 but they run really big.\u00a0 (M...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candice.french@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.62.169.169","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415124695,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280992.jpg?_r=1462713598","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":201,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissFrench","Id":280992,"Name":"MissFrench","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.216.192.237","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80082,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by MissFrench, 07 May 2016 - 05:27 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1462670854,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a3f4c235d35e6aac742fd498600cf900","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Brand new, in the box directly purchased from Ugg Australia.&amp;nbsp; Size 8 but they run really big.&amp;nbsp; (My guess is that they fit like an 8.5\/9).&amp;nbsp; I am typically a 7.5\/8 and found the size 7 to fit me comfortably.&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Soft nubuck shapes the Lucy wedge sandal from UGG Australia, in nude with braided raffia trim.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;UGG Australia \"Lucy\" nubuck sandal.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;4 1\/4\" covered wedge; 3\" equiv.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Peep toe tops 1 1\/4\" platform.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Straps crisscross over ankle.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Fixed bow at back of counter.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Leather lining and footbed.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Braided raffia-trimmed midsole.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Rubber sole provides traction.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;\"Lucy\" is imported.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;I had the hardest time finding a neutral colored wedge sandal to wear for my beach wedding.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m 5&#039;0 and needed some height but was worried about wearing heels in the sand.&amp;nbsp; These wedge style sandals were perfect because they were soft, comfortable, and TALL!&amp;nbsp; I was able to walk in the sand without sinking!&amp;nbsp; I also really liked them because they blended in with the sand and gave the appearance that I was barefoot. This design has been discontinued and very hard to find so I purchased two pairs of these sandals and never returned the ones that were too big! Originally purchased for $115.00.   Please make a reasonable offer if you&#039;re interested.&amp;nbsp; Feel free to message me with any questions!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":35683,"Name":"Ugg Lucy Back.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2016\/post-280992-0-20506000-1462666997.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2016\/post-280992-0-20506000-1462666997_thumb.jpg","Width":480,"Height":360},{"Id":35681,"Name":"Ugg Lucy.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2016\/post-280992-0-36259600-1462666977.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2016\/post-280992-0-36259600-1462666977_thumb.jpg","Width":480,"Height":360}],"Id":1913402,"PostDate":1462670627,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Brand new, in the box directly purchased from Ugg Australia.\u00a0 Size 8 but they run really big.\u00a0 (My guess is that they fit like an 8.5\/9).\u00a0 I am typically a 7.5\/8 and found the size 7 to fit me comfortably.\u00a0 <\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Soft nubuck shapes the Lucy wedge sandal from UGG Australia, in nude with braided raffia trim.<\/span><\/p>\n<ul><li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">UGG Australia \"Lucy\" nubuck sandal.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">4 1\/4\" covered wedge; 3\" equiv.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Peep toe tops 1 1\/4\" platform.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Straps crisscross over ankle.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Fixed bow at back of counter.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Leather lining and footbed.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Braided raffia-trimmed midsole.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Rubber sole provides traction.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">\"Lucy\" is imported.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul><p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">I had the hardest time finding a neutral colored wedge sandal to wear for my beach wedding.\u00a0 I'm 5'0 and needed some height but was worried about wearing heels in the sand.\u00a0 These wedge style sandals were perfect because they were soft, comfortable, and TALL!\u00a0 I was able to walk in the sand without sinking!\u00a0 I also really liked them because they blended in with the sand and gave the appearance that I was barefoot. This design has been discontinued and very hard to find so I purchased two pairs of these sandals and never returned the ones that were too big! Originally purchased for $115.00.\u00a0\u00a0 Please make a reasonable offer if you're interested.\u00a0 Feel free to message me with any questions!<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candice.french@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.62.169.169","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415124695,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280992.jpg?_r=1462713598","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":201,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissFrench","Id":280992,"Name":"MissFrench","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80082","Title":"Wedge Sandals For Sale","LastPostDate":1462670627},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
