e chair ties in the color Purple,Yellow and green. If anyone has some to sell that would be great. Or does anyone know where I can get some cheep. I am looking for about 20 of each color.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;thanks&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913261,"PostDate":1462240836,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0I am looking for some chair ties in the color Purple,Yellow and green. If anyone has some to sell that would be great. Or does anyone know where I can get some cheep. I am looking for about 20 of each color.<\/p>\n<p>thanks<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lori.yepez@aa.com","IpAddress":"173.74.136.107","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440298010,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"lorishultz2016","Id":284536,"Name":"lorishultz2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"158.106.64.94","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80072,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6454132d3761e8326c8625f0a7467f9d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"lorishultz2016\"] There are a number of sites on the internet that sell them at a pretty reasonable price. I&#039;ve seen them as low as about 40 cents each in organza. If you want satin I think they cost a little more, but not a ton. If you&#039;re only looking for about 20 of each, 60 in total, I&#039;m sure you could get them all for about $40, especially being in the US. The brides in canada are the ones that get killed on the shipping, even more so if it&#039;s a US site and they ship internationally.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.chaircoverfactory.com\/Chair-Sashes-s\/254.htm&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.chaircoverfactory.com\/Chair-Sashes-s\/254.htm&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.weddinglinensdirect.com\/chairsashes.html&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.weddinglinensdirect.com\/chairsashes.html&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.tableclothsfactory.com\/?&amp;amp;gclid=Cj0KEQjwmKG5BRDv4YaE5t6oqf0BEiQAwqDNfJ3oBW6my9uI7uovkmwNEfg6nScy_mnj0Pz1a6dHMMQaAtIr8P8HAQ&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.tableclothsfactory.com\/?&amp;amp;gclid=Cj0KEQjwmKG5BRDv4YaE5t6oqf0BEiQAwqDNfJ3oBW6my9uI7uovkmwNEfg6nScy_mnj0Pz1a6dHMMQaAtIr8P8HAQ&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.linentablecloth.com\/chair-covers-and-sashes\/chair-sashes.html&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.linentablecloth.com\/chair-covers-and-sashes\/chair-sashes.html&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.efavormart.com\/wedding-chair-sashes.aspx&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.efavormart.com\/wedding-chair-sashes.aspx&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I got mine at efavormart and they were just great so I would recommend them, but I&#039;m sure if any of the other ladies have had an experience with any of the other suppliers they&#039;ll chime in with a review.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913280,"PostDate":1462299756,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284536\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284536-lorishultz2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">lorishultz2016<\/span><\/a> There are a number of sites on the internet that sell them at a pretty reasonable price. I've seen them as low as about 40 cents each in organza. If you want satin I think they cost a little more, but not a ton. If you're only looking for about 20 of each, 60 in total, I'm sure you could get them all for about $40, especially being in the US. The brides in canada are the ones that get killed on the shipping, even more so if it's a US site and they ship internationally.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.chaircoverfactory.com\/Chair-Sashes-s\/254.htm' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.chaircove...ashes-s\/254.htm<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.weddinglinensdirect.com\/chairsashes.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingli...hairsashes.html<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.tableclothsfactory.com\/?&gclid=Cj0KEQjwmKG5BRDv4YaE5t6oqf0BEiQAwqDNfJ3oBW6my9uI7uovkmwNEfg6nScy_mnj0Pz1a6dHMMQaAtIr8P8HAQ' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.tableclot...HMMQaAtIr8P8HAQ<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.linentablecloth.com\/chair-covers-and-sashes\/chair-sashes.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.linentabl...air-sashes.html<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.efavormart.com\/wedding-chair-sashes.aspx' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.efavormar...air-sashes.aspx<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I got mine at efavormart and they were just great so I would recommend them, but I'm sure if any of the other ladies have had an experience with any of the other suppliers they'll chime in with a review.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80072","Title":"Looking For Iteams To Buy","LastPostDate":1462299756},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotif