Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.35.67.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"55456329b62b9ee603931e05dac8aeef","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"jenna32schap\"] Hi. I am a Riu palace bride and I was looking for some more info as well. Would you mind emailing me the package pricing that you have for them ana.avant@[member=\"gmail\"].com . I would soooooo appreciate it&amp;nbsp;as I am beyond lost with this process so far.&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;@BrandiNR@AmorDeMiVida I just wanted to reach out to you two bc I see we are all summer 2016 Riu Palace Cabo brides!!!! Congrats!!! I am set for June 25, 2016. I am still searching for info and I am new to this blog. Is there any info on pricing that you guys can send me &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:ana.avant@[member=\"gmail\"].com&#039;&gt;ana.avant@[member=\"gmail\"].com&lt;\/a&gt;. Thanks&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901081,"PostDate":1437745132,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277065\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277065-jenna32schap\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jenna32schap<\/span><\/a> Hi. I am a Riu palace bride and I was looking for some more info as well. Would you mind emailing me the package pricing that you have for them ana.avant@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com . I would soooooo appreciate it\u00a0as I am beyond lost with this process so far.<\/p>\n<br \/><p>@BrandiNR@AmorDeMiVida I just wanted to reach out to you two bc I see we are all summer 2016 Riu Palace Cabo brides!!!! Congrats!!! I am set for June 25, 2016. I am still searching for info and I am new to this blog. Is there any info on pricing that you guys can send me <a href='mailto:ana.avant@<a hovercard-ref=' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com'>ana.avant@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<\/a>. Thanks<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ana.avant87@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.35.67.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437741737,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284112.jpg?_r=1437784941","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":258,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CaboBride6252016","Id":284112,"Name":"CaboBride6252016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.42.28.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d14c0e0074b510b983bd7095857fd0af","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"CaboBride6252016\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congrats to you too!&amp;nbsp; I sent you an email with the information that was sent to me.&amp;nbsp; I emailed the wedding coordinator to find out if the 2016 price list was released, but I haven&#039;t received anything yet.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901151,"PostDate":1437800939,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284112\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/284112-cabobride6252016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">CaboBride6252016<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats to you too!\u00a0 I sent you an email with the information that was sent to me.\u00a0 I emailed the wedding coordinator to find out if the 2016 price list was released, but I haven't received anything yet.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jrcorrales@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.42.28.220","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413959646,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280778.jpg?_r=1421562169","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmorDeMiVida","Id":280778,"Name":"AmorDeMiVida","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.71.137.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7a41faf760029bb8864b4f075ff29940","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;hello ladies&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My wedding date is set here for May 20 2016, did anyone get the \"extras \" price list ?!?! of have any helpful tips ?!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901209,"PostDate":1437974145,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>hello ladies<\/p>\n<p>My wedding date is set here for May 20 2016, did anyone get the \"extras \" price list ?!?! of have any helpful tips ?!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberpetersen35@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"184.71.137.126","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437973870,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284153.jpeg?_r=1454355937","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Ambie","Id":284153,"Name":"Ambie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.42.28.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"73cff51c909ea855b9957f67862ec345","RawContent":"@[member=\"Ambie\"]\n\nWhat&#039;s your email? I can send info to you.","Attachments":[],"Id":1901229,"PostDate":1438008051,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284153\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/284153-ambie\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Ambie<\/span><\/a><br>\nWhat's your email? I can send info to you.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jrcorrales@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.42.28.220","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413959646,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280778.jpg?_r=1421562169","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmorDeMiVida","Id":280778,"Name":"AmorDeMiVida","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.238.180","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca6107745de20a47451db8a77c498238","RawContent":"[quote name=\"AmorDeMiVida\" post=\"1901151\" timestamp=\"1437797339\"]\n@[member=\"CaboBride6252016\"]\n\nCongrats to you too!  I sent you an email with the information that was sent to me.  I emailed the wedding coordinator to find out if the 2016 price list was released, but I haven&#039;t received anything yet.[\/quote]I looked through all of the info. I just wanted to say thanks again. Also how did you find out who your wedding coordinator was...is it on one of the original confirmation emails?","Attachments":[],"Id":1901252,"PostDate":1438022111,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>AmorDeMiVida, on 24 July 2015 - 09:08 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284112\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/284112-cabobride6252016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">CaboBride6252016<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats to you too!\u00a0 I sent you an email with the information that was sent to me.\u00a0 I emailed the wedding coordinator to find out if the 2016 price list was released, but I haven't received anything yet.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I looked through all of the info. I just wanted to say thanks again. Also how did you find out who your wedding coordinator was...is it on one of the original confirmation emails?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ana.avant87@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.35.67.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437741737,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284112.jpg?_r=1437784941","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":258,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CaboBride6252016","Id":284112,"Name":"CaboBride6252016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.42.28.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"88ec5f42b2152fc84db742d44addcb07","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"CaboBride6252016\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You&#039;re welcome!&amp;nbsp; When I booked back in December 2014, the wedding sales department confirmed everything and emailed me the name of the coordinator for the Riu Palace.&amp;nbsp; Since then it has changed from Ana Maria Noriega to &lt;span&gt;Ana Laura Martinez Davalos.&amp;nbsp; The email contact is:&amp;nbsp; &lt;span&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:mice02.sjd@riu.com&#039;&gt;mice02.sjd@riu.com&lt;\/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp; I emailed a couple weeks ago (7\/6\/15) to find out if the 2016 extras list was release yet, but I have not received a response.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901406,"PostDate":1438133072,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284112\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/284112-cabobride6252016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">CaboBride6252016<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You're welcome!\u00a0 When I booked back in December 2014, the wedding sales department confirmed everything and emailed me the name of the coordinator for the Riu Palace.\u00a0 Since then it has changed from Ana Maria Noriega to <span>Ana Laura Martinez Davalos.\u00a0 The email contact is:\u00a0 <span><a href='mailto:mice02.sjd@riu.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>mice02.sjd@riu.com<\/a>.\u00a0 I emailed a couple weeks ago (7\/6\/15) to find out if the 2016 extras list was release yet, but I have not received a response.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jrcorrales@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.42.28.220","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413959646,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280778.jpg?_r=1421562169","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmorDeMiVida","Id":280778,"Name":"AmorDeMiVida","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.71.137.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"867fa9796b91f3103ef4873d9c6feed7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:amberpetersen35@hotmail.com&#039;&gt;amberpetersen35@hotmail.com&lt;\/a&gt; thank you so much!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902059,"PostDate":1438925618,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><a href='mailto:amberpetersen35@hotmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>amberpetersen35@hotmail.com<\/a> thank you so much!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberpetersen35@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"184.71.137.126","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437973870,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284153.jpeg?_r=1454355937","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Ambie","Id":284153,"Name":"Ambie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.42.28.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"00d86782a994bd230d297a34cb749019","RawContent":"@[member=\"Ambie\"]\n\nI sent you the email this morning","Attachments":[],"Id":1902131,"PostDate":1438996397,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284153\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/284153-ambie\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Ambie<\/span><\/a><br>\nI sent you the email this morning\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jrcorrales@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.42.28.220","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413959646,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280778.jpg?_r=1421562169","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmorDeMiVida","Id":280778,"Name":"AmorDeMiVida","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"86.134.210.157","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5e598514de5caccee67c884a47709202","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Myself and Fiancee are booked into the Riu Palace Mexico for our wedding on 09\/09\/2016. Is there any chance you could forward me the price lists you have.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Would be greatly appreciated&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Ash&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905686,"PostDate":1443634519,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Myself and Fiancee are booked into the Riu Palace Mexico for our wedding on 09\/09\/2016. Is there any chance you could forward me the price lists you have.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Would be greatly appreciated<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ash<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ash.kim.wedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"86.134.210.157","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1443634290,"P